{"id":4389031225,"name":"ME: Biddle's Corner","desc":"Motorworks Entertainment presents to you: BIDDLE'S CORNER\n\nIn this update:\n\n- Implemented new back-end security features\n- Re-instated 30 day account age restriction\n- Wiped unused Datastores\n- Secured Datastores\n- Zero-trust system implemented: Player \"Risk\" now taken into account upon joining the game. Risk factors: Friends / Following a Banned Player, Player is in a Banned / Blacklisted Group. False bans or kicks may occur.\n- Slight performance changes\n- Moderation panel front/back-end remade\n- Secured / Revised delivery system [Changed base delivery pay to $500]\n- Announcement / Warning GUI added\n- In-game rules tab\nand more!\n\nExplore vast open roads with over 150+ vehicles and areas to explore! Make sure to turn on notifications to stay up to date with updates from the Motorworks Entertainment Team! \n\nControls:\n\nThrottle - W / RT\nBrake - S / LT\nSteering - A + D / Left Thumbstick\nShift Up - E / Y\nShift Down - Q / X\n\nAccount age must be over 30 days old to play!\n\nVersion 2026-RR-1.1","path":"/game/4389031225-me-biddle-s-corner","slug":"4389031225-me-biddle-s-corner","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ebeaaf10a15bf75cb8030c1f7959d591/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-39a19398ea07204865ec1cd8b698b432/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":0,"visitor":1276709,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-01-17T22:10:49.201Z","creator":{"name":"Motorworks: Overdrive","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"ME:-Biddle's-Corner-INF-MONEY-86954","_id":"696c08e90c9246429a086789","title":"INF MONEY","game":{"_id":"696c08e90c9246429a086786","gameId":4389031225,"name":"ME: Biddle's Corner","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-39a19398ea07204865ec1cd8b698b432-9fb3604d1a2d.png","placeId":4389031225},"features":"inf money","tags":[],"script":"-- change ohNumber 2 = \"